  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc3/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Review 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e: analyze_julia on the item's fixture still emits one->one (line 1) and run->run (line 2), plus fact->fact at the signature beside the true recursion. But hypergumbo run and survey drop every self-loop (cli.py:13189, since 0fb1509f35 2026-02-13; true recursion too), so the false self-edge never reaches the behavior map; the impact is on raw AnalysisResult/pass counts, not map consumers. MECHANISM: julia call detection treats a definition's signature/short-form LHS call_expression as a call. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-tuzok."  # 3de7
